id: flash-input-tap
section: Flash
item: A tap on a movie gives one press and one release at the stage point, never a doubled click
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2
kit: cavekit-flash.md R5
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
expect number n-down 1 1
expect number n-up 1 1
pause 1200
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 100 60
expect flash-at 100 60 3
expect number n-down 2 2
expect number n-up 2 2
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm1
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
expect number n-down 1 1
expect number n-up 1 1
